OL,3,GNEWSAWoman reunited with lost teenage
OL,4,Adiary from 1975
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike many teenagers, Judy Smith wrote
OL,7,Fdown some of her most intimate thoughts
OL,8,Fin a personal diary.
OL,10,FNow she has been reunited with the
OL,11,Fjournal she kept when she was 16 after
OL,12,Fit was found in an east London flat.
OL,14,FThe diary was discovered by
OL,15,Ffather-and-son builders Jim and Charlie
OL,16,FGrace who were renovating the property
OL,17,Fand coincidentally live in North Weald,
OL,18,Fthe same Essex village as the diary's
OL,19,Fauthor.
OL,21,FSmith, now 67, said it was "incredible"
OL,22,Fto have the diary returned.
